{"label": "94ca04cde8d0380acfe8", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "reading_aloud", "referents": [{"word": "the market swoon", "refers_to": "the Bitcoin price/ETF outflow decline, completed by 'Bitcoin spot price fell below 70,000' in the selection", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [{"text": "for the year (year-to-date flows)", "inside": true}], "retraction": "He later corrects the figure: 'I just looked and the year-to- date flows is like a negative 1.4 billion' (vs. 1.5 billion).", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Bitcoin ETFs are down over 1.5 billion in net outflows this year, and recent redemptions explain the price swoon, with Bitcoin falling below 70,000 on Friday, its lowest since August.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "Can you can you finally answer for me once and for all are these following price or are they leading price?"},
{"label": "a9e55fb94cc7f66d419e", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "the real test", "refers_to": "whether Bitcoin holds the 200 weekly moving average, explained only after the selection", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "yes"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Bitcoin has crashed to 67K, and now comes the real test (of the 200 weekly moving average).", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "Thanks, Scott. Take care."},
{"label": "d6b855ab3f12b6436727", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "those", "refers_to": "U.S. spot Bitcoin ETFs (named immediately after in the selection)", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "the dip", "refers_to": "the Bitcoin price decline described earlier (below $68,000, down 17%)", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "it", "refers_to": "the more than half a billion dollars that flowed out", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [{"text": "this week", "inside": true}], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Big investors are not buying the dip; more than half a billion dollars flowed out of U.S. spot Bitcoin ETFs this week, mostly from BlackRock's fund.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "guest", "speaker_evidence": "MACKENZIE SIGALOS BACK WITH US WITH MORE MAC."},
{"label": "38dc9d04d8b6a7e25a10", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [], "conditions": [{"text": "if we want Bitcoin to succeed", "inside": true}], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "If we want Bitcoin to succeed, one of the few things we need to do is separate ourselves from all the scammers and shitcoin land.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "I endorse the message that Brian just said."},
{"label": "6a638f56d35b55ada6c9", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "question", "referents": [{"word": "that chart", "refers_to": "a mining-pool block-distribution chart shown earlier, not in the selection", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}, {"word": "That", "refers_to": "the concern/question just stated in the selection", "inside": true, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [{"text": "if, say, three or four pools find most of the blocks", "inside": true}], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "People's concern is that if three or four pools find most of the blocks, Bitcoin might be centralized — a great question, which he then answers (yes, if pools don't let users build their own templates).", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "guest", "speaker_evidence": "Obviously, I love Bitcoin mining, I wrote the Bitcoin Miner's Almanac"},
{"label": "7a033059dd483e36a8db", "speaker_changes_inside": "no", "view": "own_sincere", "referents": [{"word": "this", "refers_to": "the point he was making just before (the Simply Bitcoin tweet about hodling), outside the selection", "inside": false, "changes_assertion": "no"}], "conditions": [], "retraction": "none", "time_ok": "yes", "proposition": "Bitcoin truly changed his life — his finances, his livelihood, where he lives, and how he views the world.", "certainty": "certain", "speaker_is": "host", "speaker_evidence": "McFly Opti, for real, thank you for carrying the weight of the show."},
